<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57478" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κιννάβᾰρ-ι</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, τό</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cinnabar, bisulphuret of
				mercury</i>, whence <i>vermilion</i> is obtained, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				378a26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Lap.</u>
				58
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.94
			</span></i>; thought by some to be <i>serpent's blood</i>, Dsc.l.c.,
				<i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				33.116
			</span></i>:—a masc.form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κιννάβαρις</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Anaxandr.
				14
			</span></i>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τεγγάβαρι</span></b>  (q.v.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρυθρόδανον</span>
			, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.143
			</span></i> (-<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ρις</span>).</div>
